-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186362193}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "8b9417ea-ba7a-5730-8e58-6896008edf54" :question/math-academy-id "q-98324" :question/problem "Which of the following curves is *not* closed?" :question/worked-solution "A curve is closed if its terminal point coincides with its initial point. So, a curve whose terminal point does not coincide with its initial point is not closed. \n\nOf the given options, the only one that is not a closed curve is the following:\n\n![](images/a8/a8d86005a372a0d452f4b6dafceeccc7bad188193de08bce86c6d89864902451.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186395500 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186172049 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "337518a9-39a1-57e3-8686-74a135f7c3d7" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Oriented Curves"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8fce3160-867a-5ae8-9b15-04db460053d2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/03/03fca239767a3b71681507bd861161147c1b39e90ee827b57dc74dcd66eaf24c.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186395502} {:answer/id #uuid "21caeae6-658c-56b3-af48-83fd9e9decee" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/2a/2aeba887da1e1a4d3795471ca90760660d6f4f8bf18e312b33cab650093f2a78.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186395503} {:answer/id #uuid "7de5c32f-87da-5b1e-93b9-166a24111b7a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/bf/bf45e57bc97f48fd9e60df79afd3cfcb225915b972e4fd02473552008be65eb1.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186395504} {:answer/id #uuid "1496798f-856a-57f3-8533-c288dfb0d9ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/8b/8b08d7b6f11d9ef27d98f995ac8ffd1ace1c12053ecc80c1aa17266854bf86b3.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186395505} {:answer/id #uuid "b5fcec4f-8c18-5